# Health entries (general information only, no medicine doses). Every answer ends with a doctor / 112 line.
E = [
("health-fainting", ["koi behosh ho jaye to kya karein", "someone fainted", "chakkar aakar gir gaya", "what to do when a person faints", "behoshi ke baad kya karna chahiye", "kisi ko chakkar aa jaye to"],
 "Use seedha litao, pair thode upar rakho aur kasa hua kapda dhila karo. Saans dekho; ek minute mein hosh na aaye ya saans na aaye to turant 112 karo. Hosh aane ke baad bhi doctor ko dikhao.",
 "Lay the person flat, raise the legs a little and loosen tight clothing. Check breathing; if they do not wake within a minute or are not breathing, call 112 at once. Ask a doctor even after they recover.", ["health"]),
("health-choking", ["gale mein kuch atak jaye to kya karein", "someone is choking", "khana gale mein phans gaya", "what to do if a person is choking", "choking ho to kya karna chahiye", "saans ki nali mein khana atak gaya"],
 "Agar vyakti khansi kar pa raha hai to use khansne do. Agar wo khans, bol ya saans na le paye to madad ke liye chillao, 112 karo aur kandhon ke beech mein zor se thapki do. Pet dabane ka tareeka kisi first-aid course mein seekho; doctor ya 112 se salah lo.",
 "If the person can cough, let them cough. If they cannot cough, speak or breathe, shout for help, call 112 and give firm back blows between the shoulder blades. Learn the abdominal thrust method in a first-aid course and ask a doctor or call 112.", ["health"]),
("health-cpr", ["cpr kaise karte hain", "cpr kya hota hai", "what is cpr", "how is cpr done", "cpr ke basic steps", "dil band ho jaye to cpr kaise dete hain"],
 "Agar vyakti behosh hai aur saans normal nahi le raha, pehle 112 karo. Phir seene ke beech mein hathon se tez aur gehra dabao, lagbhag 100 se 120 baar ek minute mein. CPR kisi manyata prapt course mein seekhna sabse accha hai.",
 "If the person is unresponsive and not breathing normally, call 112 first. Then push hard and fast in the centre of the chest, about 100 to 120 times a minute. It is best to learn CPR in a certified course.", ["health"]),
("health-heart-attack", ["heart attack ke lakshan kya hain", "heart attack ke signs", "signs of a heart attack", "dil ka daura padne par kya hota hai", "chhati mein dard heart attack to nahi", "heart attack symptoms"],
 "Seene mein dabav ya dard jo haath, jabde ya peeth tak jaye, pasina, saans phoolna, ji machlana aur chakkar aana ye lakshan ho sakte hain. Turant 112 karo, aaram se baitho aur khud gaadi mat chalao. Doctor ko dikhana zaroori hai.",
 "Chest pressure or pain that spreads to the arm, jaw or back, sweating, breathlessness, nausea and dizziness can be signs. Call 112 at once, sit down and rest, and do not drive yourself. A doctor must check it.", ["health"]),
("health-stroke", ["stroke ke lakshan kya hain", "stroke ki pehchaan kaise karein", "signs of a stroke", "what is the fast test for stroke", "lakwa kya hota hai", "stroke fast ka matlab kya hai"],
 "FAST yaad rakho: Face (chehra ek taraf latakna), Arm (ek haath kamzor), Speech (bolne mein dikkat), Time (turant 112 karo). Samay bahut keemti hai, der mat karo. Doctor ke paas jaldi pahunchna zaroori hai.",
 "Remember FAST: Face drooping on one side, Arm weakness, Speech difficulty, Time to call 112. Every minute counts, so do not wait. Getting to a doctor quickly is essential.", ["health"]),
("health-heat-stroke", ["heat stroke kya hota hai", "loo lagne par kya karein", "lu lag gayi to kya karna chahiye", "what to do in heat stroke", "heatstroke ke lakshan", "garmi se behosh ho jana"],
 "Bahut tez garmi mein sharir ka taapmaan bahut badh sakta hai: bhram, tez sar dard, behoshi ho sakti hai. Vyakti ko chhaon aur thandi jagah le jao, sharir par thanda paani ya geela kapda lagao aur 112 karo. Doctor ko zaroor dikhao.",
 "In very hot weather body temperature can rise dangerously, causing confusion, a bad headache or fainting. Move the person to shade, cool the body with water or a wet cloth and call 112. Ask a doctor in every case.", ["health"]),
("health-dehydration", ["dehydration ke lakshan kya hain", "pani ki kami ke signs", "signs of dehydration", "sharir mein pani ki kami kaise pata chale", "dehydration kya hota hai", "what is dehydration"],
 "Zyada pyaas, gaadha peela peshab, sookha muh, sar dard aur chakkar aana dehydration ke lakshan hain. Dheere dheere pani ya ORS ke ghoont lo. Zyada kamzori ya behoshi ho to doctor ya 112.",
 "Strong thirst, dark yellow urine, a dry mouth, headache and dizziness are signs of dehydration. Sip water or ORS slowly. If there is severe weakness or fainting, see a doctor or call 112.", ["health"]),
("health-ors", ["ors kya hai", "ors kaise banate hain", "what is ors", "ors ka istemal kab karte hain", "oral rehydration solution kya hota hai", "ors ghol kaise banta hai"],
 "ORS pani aur namak-cheeni ka santulit mix hai jo dast ya ulti mein khoye pani ki bharpai karta hai. Packet par jaise likha ho waise hi saaf paani mein ghoolo, cheeni ya namak apni marzi se mat badlo. Bachchon ya zyada dast mein doctor se poochho.",
 "ORS is a balanced mix of salts and sugar that replaces water lost in diarrhoea or vomiting. Mix it in clean water exactly as printed on the packet and do not add extra sugar or salt. Ask a doctor for children or serious diarrhoea.", ["health"]),
("health-sprain", ["moch aa jaye to kya karein", "sprain ka ilaj kya hai", "pair mudne par kya karna chahiye", "what to do for a sprain", "rice method for sprain", "ankle twist ho jaye to"],
 "RICE yaad rakho: Rest (aaram), Ice (kapde mein lipti baraf, 20 minute tak), Compression (halki patti), Elevation (pair upar). Sujan zyada ho, bhaar na pad sake ya dard na ghate to doctor ko dikhao.",
 "Remember RICE: Rest, Ice (wrapped in cloth, up to 20 minutes at a time), Compression with a light bandage, and Elevation. If swelling is severe, you cannot put weight on it or the pain does not ease, see a doctor.", ["health"]),
("health-scrape", ["skin chhil jaye to kya karein", "chhil gayi skin par kya lagayein", "kharonch lag gayi to kya karna chahiye", "what to do for a minor scrape", "scraped knee care", "graze ka first aid"],
 "Chhili hui jagah ko saaf bahte pani aur halke sabun se dhoyo, phir saaf patti se dhak do. Gehri, gandi ya lal hoti aur sujti jagah ho to doctor ko dikhao.",
 "Wash the scraped skin with clean running water and mild soap, then cover it with a clean bandage. If it is deep, dirty, or turns red and swollen, see a doctor.", ["health"]),
("health-insect-sting", ["bhanwre ya madhumakkhi ke katne par kya karein", "bee sting ka ilaj", "what to do for an insect sting", "keede ke dank par kya karein", "ter ya bichhu ke dank ke baad", "wasp sting kya karein"],
 "Dank ka kaanta ho to naakhun ya card se kharoch kar nikalo, jagah dhoyo aur thanda kapda lagao. Chehre ya gale mein sujan, saans mein dikkat ya chakkar ho to turant 112 karo. Doctor ko dikhao.",
 "If a stinger is left, scrape it out with a nail or card, wash the area and apply a cold cloth. Swelling of the face or throat, trouble breathing or dizziness needs 112 at once. Ask a doctor.", ["health"]),
("health-eye-irritation", ["aankh mein kuch chala jaye to kya karein", "aankh mein jalan ho to", "what to do if something gets in the eye", "aankh mein dhool chali gayi", "eye irritation ka upay", "aankh lal ho gayi kya karein"],
 "Aankh ko masalo mat aur saaf bahte pani se kuch minute dhoyo. Rasayan ya tez dard ho to 15 minute dhote raho aur turant hospital jao, bina salah ke dawa na daalo.",
 "Do not rub the eye and rinse it with clean running water for a few minutes. For a chemical or severe pain, keep rinsing for 15 minutes and go to a hospital at once, and use no drops without advice.", ["health"]),
("health-electric-shock", ["bijli ka jhatka lage to kya karein", "electric shock lag jaye to", "what to do in an electric shock", "karant lag gaya to kya karna chahiye", "bijli ki taar se jhatka lage to", "electric shock ka first aid"],
 "Bijli chalu ho to vyakti ko chhuo mat, pehle main switch band karo. Phir 112 karo aur saans dekho. Halka jhatka ho tab bhi doctor ko dikhao.",
 "Do not touch the person while the power is on; switch off at the main switch first. Then call 112 and check breathing. See a doctor even after a mild shock.", ["health"]),
("health-seizure", ["mirgi ka daura pade to kya karein", "seizure aaye to kya karna chahiye", "what to do during a seizure", "daura padne par kya karein", "fits aa jaye to kya karein", "epilepsy attack mein madad"],
 "Vyakti ko chot se bachao, aas paas ki cheezein hata do aur muh mein kuch mat daalo. Daura khatam ho to use karwat par litao. Daura 5 minute se zyada chale ya pehli baar pade to 112 karo aur doctor ko dikhao.",
 "Protect the person from injury, clear things around them and put nothing in the mouth. When it ends, turn them onto their side. If it lasts more than 5 minutes or it is the first one, call 112 and see a doctor.", ["health"]),
("health-poisoning", ["zeher kha liya to kya karein", "poisoning ho jaye to kya karna chahiye", "what to do in case of poisoning", "galti se kuch zehreela pi liya", "kisi ne dawai ya chemical nigal liya", "poison swallowed kya karein"],
 "Turant 112 karo ya vyakti ko seedha hospital le jao. Doctor ke kehne ke bina ulti mat karwao. Jis cheez ka sevan hua ho uska dibba ya packet saath le jao.",
 "Call 112 at once or take the person straight to a hospital. Do not make them vomit unless a doctor says so. Take the container or packet of what was swallowed with you.", ["health"]),
("health-fever-doctor", ["bukhar mein doctor ko kab dikhana chahiye", "when to see a doctor for fever", "kitne din ke bukhar ke baad doctor ke paas jayein", "fever kab khatarnak hota hai", "bukhar ke danger signs", "when is fever serious"],
 "Bukhar 3 din se zyada rahe, bahut tez ho, ya saath mein akdi hui gardan, daane, saans ki dikkat ya bhram ho to doctor ko dikhao. Chhote bachchon, buzurgon aur garbhvati mahilaon mein der mat karo.",
 "See a doctor if a fever lasts more than 3 days, is very high, or comes with a stiff neck, rash, breathing trouble or confusion. Do not wait in young babies, older people or pregnant women.", ["health"]),
("health-body-temperature", ["sharir ka normal taapmaan kitna hota hai", "normal body temperature", "bukhar kitne degree se shuru hota hai", "what is normal body temperature", "98.6 fahrenheit kya hai", "fever kitne degree par hota hai"],
 "Sharir ka aam taapmaan lagbhag 37 degree Celsius (98.6 Fahrenheit) hota hai. Lagbhag 38 degree Celsius (100.4 Fahrenheit) se upar ko bukhar maana jata hai. Shak ho to doctor se poochho.",
 "Normal body temperature is about 37 degrees Celsius (98.6 Fahrenheit). A reading from about 38 degrees Celsius (100.4 Fahrenheit) is counted as fever. Ask a doctor if unsure.", ["health"]),
("health-pulse", ["normal pulse rate kitna hota hai", "naadi ki gati kitni honi chahiye", "resting pulse kitna hona chahiye", "what is a normal resting pulse", "normal heart rate kya hai", "pulse kitni honi chahiye"],
 "Aaram ki halat mein bade logon ki naadi aam taur par 60 se 100 baar ek minute mein hoti hai. Sehat aur fitness ke hisaab se thodi alag ho sakti hai. Chinta ho to doctor se poochho.",
 "At rest an adult's pulse is usually 60 to 100 beats a minute. It can differ a little with fitness and health. Ask a doctor if you are worried.", ["health"]),
("health-blood-pressure", ["normal bp kitna hota hai", "blood pressure kitna hona chahiye", "what is normal blood pressure", "bp ki normal range kya hai", "120 by 80 bp kya hota hai", "healthy bp kitna hota hai"],
 "Bade logon ka aam taur par normal blood pressure lagbhag 120/80 mmHg mana jata hai. Aapke liye kya theek hai ye doctor tay karte hain. Baar baar zyada reading aaye to doctor ko dikhao.",
 "A normal adult blood pressure is commonly taken as about 120/80 mmHg. A doctor decides what is right for you. If readings are often high, see a doctor.", ["health"]),
("health-sleep-hours", ["kitne ghante sona chahiye", "how many hours of sleep do we need", "adults ko kitni neend chahiye", "bachchon ko kitni neend zaroori hai", "recommended sleep hours", "ek din mein kitni neend leni chahiye"],
 "Bade logon ko aam taur par 7 se 9 ghante, kishoron ko 8 se 10 ghante aur school jaane wale bachchon ko 9 se 12 ghante ki neend chahiye. Chhote bachchon ko aur zyada. Neend ki dikkat ho to doctor se milo.",
 "Adults usually need 7 to 9 hours of sleep, teenagers 8 to 10 hours and school-age children 9 to 12 hours. Younger children need even more. See a doctor if you have trouble sleeping.", ["health"]),
("health-water-intake", ["din mein kitna pani peena chahiye", "how much water should i drink", "roz kitne glass pani peena chahiye", "daily water intake kitna hona chahiye", "kitna paani peena sehat ke liye theek hai", "how many glasses of water a day"],
 "Mote taur par bahut se bade log din mein lagbhag 8 glass (kareeb 2 litre) pani peete hain. Garmi, kasrat ya bimari mein zyada chahiye. Gurde ya dil ki bimari ho to doctor se poochho.",
 "As a rough guide many adults drink about 8 glasses (around 2 litres) of water a day. You need more in heat, exercise or illness. If you have kidney or heart disease, ask a doctor.", ["health"]),
("health-handwashing", ["haath kitni der tak dhona chahiye", "haath dhone ka sahi tareeka", "how long should i wash my hands", "handwashing kaise karein", "haath dhone se kya fayda hota hai", "how to wash hands properly"],
 "Haath gile karke sabun lagao aur kam se kam 20 second malo, ungliyon ke beech aur nakhoon ke neeche bhi. Phir saaf pani se dhoyo aur sukha lo. Khana khane se pehle aur toilet ke baad zaroor dhoyo.",
 "Wet your hands, apply soap and rub for at least 20 seconds, including between the fingers and under the nails. Rinse with clean water and dry. Always wash before eating and after the toilet.", ["health"]),
("health-headache-red-flags", ["sar dard kab khatarnak hota hai", "headache ke danger signs", "sar dard mein doctor ko kab dikhayein", "when is a headache serious", "headache red flags", "tez sar dard ke saath kya dikkat ho to hospital jayein"],
 "Achanak bahut tez sar dard, bukhar ke saath akdi gardan, chot ke baad sar dard, nazar dhundhli hona, kamzori ya bhram ho to turant doctor ya 112 se sampark karo. Baar baar hone wale sar dard ke liye bhi doctor ko dikhao.",
 "A sudden very severe headache, headache with fever and a stiff neck, after an injury, or with blurred vision, weakness or confusion needs a doctor or 112 at once. See a doctor for headaches that keep coming back too.", ["health"]),
("health-motion-sickness", ["gaadi mein ulti kyun aati hai", "motion sickness se kaise bachein", "safar mein ji machlana kaise rokein", "how to avoid motion sickness", "bus mein ulti ka upay", "travel sickness ka ilaj"],
 "Saamne sadak ya kshitij ki taraf dekho, gaadi ke beech ya aage ki seat lo, taazi hawa aane do aur safar mein padhna ya phone mat dekho. Halka khana khao. Zyada dikkat ho to doctor se salah lo.",
 "Look at the road ahead or the horizon, sit in the front or middle, let in fresh air and avoid reading or using the phone while travelling. Eat lightly. Ask a doctor if it is severe.", ["health"]),
("health-sunburn", ["sunburn ho jaye to kya karein", "dhoop se skin kaali ya lal ho gayi", "what to do for sunburn", "sunburn se kaise bachein", "sunburn ka ilaj"],
 "Dhoop se hat jao, thande (baraf ke nahi) pani ka kapda lagao, bahut pani piyo aur halka moisturiser lagao. Dhoop se bachne ke liye kapde, topi aur sunscreen use karo. Chhale, bukhar ya zyada dard ho to doctor ko dikhao.",
 "Get out of the sun, apply a cool (not icy) wet cloth, drink plenty of water and use a light moisturiser. To prevent it use clothing, a hat and sunscreen. If there are blisters, fever or severe pain, see a doctor.", ["health"]),
("health-first-aid-kit", ["first aid box mein kya kya hona chahiye", "first aid kit mein kya rakhna chahiye", "what should be in a first aid kit", "first aid kit contents", "ghar ke first aid box ka saman", "first aid kit kaise banayein"],
 "Patti aur saaf gauze, medical tape, antiseptic wipes, kainchi, chimta, dastane, thermometer aur zaroori phone numbers rakho. Doctor ki likhi apni dawaiyan alag rakho. Samay samay par expiry check karo.",
 "Keep bandages, clean gauze, medical tape, antiseptic wipes, scissors, tweezers, gloves, a thermometer and emergency numbers. Keep your own prescribed medicines separately and check expiry dates now and then.", ["health"]),
("health-brushing-teeth", ["daant kitni baar brush karne chahiye", "how often should i brush my teeth", "brush karne ka sahi tareeka", "daanton ki safai kaise karein", "how long should i brush", "teeth brush kitni der karna chahiye"],
 "Din mein do baar, har baar 2 minute, naram brush aur fluoride wale toothpaste se brush karo. Brush har 3 mahine mein badlo aur roz floss karo. Dantkaar ko saal mein ek ya do baar dikhao.",
 "Brush twice a day for 2 minutes each time with a soft brush and fluoride toothpaste. Replace the brush every 3 months and floss daily. Visit a dentist once or twice a year.", ["health"]),
("health-toothache", ["daant dard ho to kya karein", "toothache ka gharelu upay", "what to do for a toothache", "daant mein dard ka ilaj", "toothache kab khatarnak hai", "daant dard mein dentist ko kab dikhayein"],
 "Gungune pani se kulla karo, daanton ke beech halke se floss karo aur bahut garam ya thanda khane se bacho. Daant ke dard ka asli ilaj dentist hi kar sakte hain, jaldi dikhao. Sujan ya bukhar ho to turant.",
 "Rinse with lukewarm water, floss gently between the teeth and avoid very hot or cold food. Only a dentist can fix the cause, so go soon, and at once if there is swelling or fever. Ask a doctor.", ["health"]),
("health-bmi", ["bmi kya hota hai", "bmi kaise nikalte hain", "what is bmi", "how to calculate bmi", "body mass index formula", "bmi ka formula kya hai"],
 "BMI = vajan (kg) ko lambai (meter) ke varg se bhaag do. WHO ke hisaab se bade logon mein 18.5 se 24.9 normal mana jata hai. Ye sirf mota andaza hai, doctor se poochho.",
 "BMI = weight in kg divided by height in metres squared. By the WHO scale 18.5 to 24.9 is normal for adults. It is only a rough guide, so ask a doctor.", ["health", "math"]),
("health-balanced-diet", ["santulit aahar kya hota hai", "balanced diet kya hai", "what is a balanced diet", "healthy khana kya hota hai", "sehat ke liye kya khana chahiye", "healthy diet kaisa hona chahiye"],
 "Roz phal, sabziyan, saabut anaaj, dal ya anya protein khao aur cheeni, namak aur talle khane kam rakho. Poori diet ke liye doctor ya dietitian se poochho.",
 "Eat fruit, vegetables, whole grains and pulses or other protein every day, and keep sugar, salt and fried food low. For a full diet plan ask a doctor or dietitian.", ["health"]),
]
